WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:32.040
One local workspace for the conversation, facts and decision.

00:00:32.040 --> 00:01:07.200
First install needs internet. The offline demo needs no account or key.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:43.280
Answers persist. Refresh resumes the correct saved question.

00:01:43.280 --> 00:02:21.680
Review-only by default. Notes never grant automatic permission.

00:02:21.680 --> 00:03:01.960
Observed local replies, not campaign sends or conversion claims.

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:36.960
Read the context. Check facts. Edit the exact draft.

00:03:36.960 --> 00:04:15.120
Deliberate local failure and recorded simulation, not real delivery.

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:55.280
New customer context blocks approval of the older draft.

00:04:55.280 --> 00:05:28.480
Readable reasons and keyboard-operated disclosures on small screens.

00:05:28.480 --> 00:06:01.000
Explicit rules, pause/stop controls and visible unresolved work.

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:45.160
153 local backend tests. Independent local review, not live E2E proof.

00:06:45.160 --> 00:07:29.800
Setup explainer only. No live account or model is connected here.

00:07:29.800 --> 00:08:14.320
Local review artifact. A controlled test inbox comes before real use.
